bodies-title = Same agent, any body.
bodies-text = It can live in a kitchen speaker, a wall tablet, a phone or a browser tab — or a small robot that turns its head toward you. Wherever it is, it’s the same Nestor, with the same memory.
bodies-speaker = speaker
bodies-tablet = wall tablet
bodies-phone = phone
bodies-browser = browser tab
bodies-robot = robot
bodies-twin = One of its possible bodies: a Reachy Mini, here simulated, listening, thinking, speaking and laughing with the voice.
